    {
      "text": "Split vanilla bean lengthwise with the tip of a sharp knife. Holding the pod open, scrape seeds from each half using the flat side of the knife. Transfer seeds to a large bowl; discard pod.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ILRhyGKapdlP7mZlhFnx98ZwmZ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/247089-Vanilla-Chantilly-Cream-DDMFS-Step-3-0656-7b93555f17984a4fbf5b0228bf91028a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/247089/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cream over vanilla seeds; add sugar and vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JwgnLwzBApylphW7O7SBLhVrOT0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/247089-Vanilla-Chantilly-Cream-DDMFS-Step-5-0662-d10ecdd039214b318ff0e31193a85b8a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/247089/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whip cream with an electric mixer until soft peaks form, 3 to 5 minutes; cover with plastic wrap and chill until ready to serve.",
